    },
    {
      "id": "cDLGobWsyQlnNOZGx-RAn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 959.4131746656899,
      "y": 1491.0372409243075,
      "width": 215.119873046875,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0M",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 912078196,
      "version": 856,
      "versionNonce": 733250400,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "Pl3L8ORIZ7r1x7GqwKPOd",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1795252833569,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "constructor(){\n  ImageDisplay = None\n}",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "constructor(){\n  ImageDisplay = None\n}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wmlu-lEDmB5N3FHvL0g9j",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1772.766217268228,
      "y": 1185.2037651756095,
      "width": 633.339599609375,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0N",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 84905548,
      "version": 353,
      "versionNonce": 2098009952,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795252833569,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Proxy has reference of ImageDisplay\n2. In its constructor we assign the reference to None\n3. when client actually calls display()\n        |- at that time we check\n        |- if reference is none then create an actual new reference\n        |- call diaplay method\n        |- else directly call display method",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Proxy has reference of ImageDisplay\n2. In its constructor we assign the reference to None\n3. when client actually calls display()\n        |- at that time we check\n        |- if reference is none then create an actual new reference\n        |- call diaplay method\n        |- else directly call display method",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7LepgJLg4-OsX2Og9Wen1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1779.9328839348952,
      "y": 1447.7037651756098,
      "width": 836.51953125,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0O",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 487625036,
      "version": 618,
      "versionNonce": 1043540832,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795252833569,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Now only when client calls display method \nat that time heay task is done\n\n2. No wastage of memory and resources when object is created\nas we saw heavy computation is done as soon as object is created\n\n3. We could have changed the actual ImageDisplay constructir\nto an new function that will run only when display is called\nBut what is ImageDisplay is 3rd party and we have no access to it\n\n4. If later we want to make PDF display or Text diaplay we can easily do as we have\ncreated an interafce Display",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Now only when client calls display method \nat that time heay task is done\n\n2. No wastage of memory and resources when object is created\nas we saw heavy computation is done as soon as object is created\n\n3. We could have changed the actual ImageDisplay constructir\nto an new function that will run only when display is called\nBut what is ImageDisplay is 3rd party and we have no access to it\n\n4. If later we want to make PDF display or Text diaplay we can easily do as we have\ncreated an interafce Display",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "bDCa21XhTlM_ZcXJ71CM-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 351.93427884964376,
      "y": 1852.9227134088965,
      "width": 725.4195556640625,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0P",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1678226548,
      "version": 439,
      "versionNonce": 1176984224,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795254198229,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In proxy design pattern important point is\n    |- Proxy class has\n        |- is-a relationship with Interface of main class\n        |- has-a relationship with main class\n        |- client alwasy has proxy reference and not actual object reference",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In proxy design pattern important point is\n    |- Proxy class has\n        |- is-a relationship with Interface of main class\n        |- has-a relationship with main class\n        |- client alwasy has proxy reference and not actual object reference",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "W9QjzPmawDeHr1v_oyDRr",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 312.2492762717327,
      "y": 1835.1049095522578,
      "width": 790.2985690018486,
      "height": 166.20073722711732,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0Q",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1247266036,
      "version": 231,
      "versionNonce": 239504224,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795254202616,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "dqSojj9NE5IxxidnAQSfl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 555.0968668828618,
